          "title": "College 8: volledige uitwerking enkelvoudig",
          "html": "<table><caption>ANOVA van enkelvoudig</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Variatiebron</th><th scope=\"col\">SS</th><th scope=\"col\">df</th><th scope=\"col\">MS</th><th scope=\"col\">F</th><th scope=\"col\">p</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Regressie</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">7.560.832.260,70</span></td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">7.560.832.260,70</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">258,500</span></td><td>&lt; <span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td></tr><tr><td>Residu</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">4.679.823.047,94</span></td><td>160</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">29.248.894,05</span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Totaal</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">12.240.655.308,64</span></td><td>161</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Controle: SS totaal = SS regressie + SS residu. MSE = SS residu / 160; de wortel uit MSE is sₑ = <span class=\"inline-value\">€ 5.408,22</span>. R² = SS regressie / SS totaal = <span class=\"inline-value\">0,618</span>. De globale F-toets toetst H₀: alle opgenomen hellingscoëfficiënten zijn nul, tegen H₁: minstens één is niet nul. Bij <span class=\"inline-expression\">α = 0,05</span> verwerpen we H₀. Dat toont een gezamenlijk verband, maar bewijst niet dat het model aan alle voorwaarden voldoet.</p><table><caption>Coëfficiënten van enkelvoudig</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Term</th><th scope=\"col\">B</th><th scope=\"col\">SE(B)</th><th scope=\"col\">t</th><th scope=\"col\">p (tweezijdig)</th><th scope=\"col\">VIF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constante</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-2.682.753,314</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">167.899,391</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-15,978</span></td><td>&lt; <span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td><td>n.v.t.</td></tr><tr><td>Bouwjaar</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1.343,315</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">83,550</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">16,078</span></td><td>&lt; <span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1,000</span></td></tr></tbody></table><figure class=\"learning-figure\"><a href=\"assets/learning/college8-enkelvoudig.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/learning/college8-enkelvoudig.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" alt=\"Werkelijke tegen voorspelde waarde en residuen voor enkelvoudig; gemarkeerde auto’s staan ook in de diagnosetabel.\"></a><figcaption>De diagonale lijn geeft werkelijke waarde = voorspelling; de tweede grafiek toont residuen en auto-nummers voor nader onderzoek. Open voor vergroting.</figcaption></figure><table><caption>Diagnoses met de cursusgrenzen</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Controle</th><th scope=\"col\">Uitkomst</th><th scope=\"col\">Grens</th><th scope=\"col\">Auto-nummers voor nader onderzoek</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Uitbijters y</td><td>z min <span class=\"inline-value\">-2,720</span>; max <span class=\"inline-value\">3,469</span></td><td>±3</td><td>23, 107</td></tr><tr><td>Uitbijters x</td><td>MD max <span class=\"inline-value\">2,813</span></td><td>Gemiddelde + 3s = <span class=\"inline-value\">3,632</span></td><td>Geen</td></tr><tr><td>Invloed</td><td>Cook max <span class=\"inline-value\">0,075</span></td><td>Gemiddelde + 3s = <span class=\"inline-value\">0,038</span></td><td>1, 23, 107, 117</td></tr><tr><td>Multicollineariteit</td><td>VIF max <span class=\"inline-value\">1,000</span></td><td>10</td><td>Geen overschrijding</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Normaliteit:</strong> KS met Lilliefors-correctie (benadering), toetsingsgrootheid <span class=\"inline-value\">0,059</span>, p <span class=\"inline-value\">0,233</span>. Bij <span class=\"inline-expression\">α = 0,05</span> verwerpen we H₀ van normale residuen niet. Dit bewijst niet dat de verdeling exact normaal is.</p><table><caption>Heteroscedasticiteit: Pearsoncorrelatie van ABSRES met elke opgenomen x</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Verklarende variabele</th><th scope=\"col\">r</th><th scope=\"col\">p tweezijdig</th><th scope=\"col\">Signaal bij <span class=\"inline-value\">0,05</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bouwjaar</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,377</span></td><td>&lt; <span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td><td>Ja</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"source-notes\" data-no-terms>Bronnen: <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-22\" data-source-note=\"22\" aria-label=\"Bron 22\">[22]</a> <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-24\" data-source-note=\"24\" aria-label=\"Bron 24\">[24]</a> <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-23\" data-source-note=\"23\" aria-label=\"Bron 23\">[23]</a></p>",
