          "html": "<table><caption>ANOVA van Electrisch</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Variatiebron</th><th scope=\"col\">SS</th><th scope=\"col\">df</th><th scope=\"col\">MS</th><th scope=\"col\">F</th><th scope=\"col\">p</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Regressie</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">2.720.719.216,40</span></td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">544.143.843,28</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">33,759</span></td><td>&lt; <span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td></tr><tr><td>Residu</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">548.030.533,60</span></td><td>34</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">16.118.545,11</span></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Totaal</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">3.268.749.750,00</span></td><td>39</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Controle: SS totaal = SS regressie + SS residu. MSE = SS residu / 34; de wortel uit MSE is sₑ = <span class=\"inline-value\">€ 4.014,79</span>. R² = SS regressie / SS totaal = <span class=\"inline-value\">0,832</span>. De globale F-toets toetst H₀: alle opgenomen hellingscoëfficiënten zijn nul, tegen H₁: minstens één is niet nul. Bij <span class=\"inline-expression\">α = 0,05</span> verwerpen we H₀. Dat toont een gezamenlijk verband, maar bewijst niet dat het model aan alle voorwaarden voldoet.</p><table><caption>Coëfficiënten van Electrisch</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Term</th><th scope=\"col\">B</th><th scope=\"col\">SE(B)</th><th scope=\"col\">t</th><th scope=\"col\">p (tweezijdig)</th><th scope=\"col\">VIF</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constante</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">12.054,399</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">10.680,539</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1,129</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,267</span></td><td>n.v.t.</td></tr><tr><td>Kilometerstand</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-0,031</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,017</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-1,776</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,085</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">2,800</span></td></tr><tr><td>Nieuwprijs bij aanschaf</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-0,553</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,157</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-3,520</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,001</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">3,978</span></td></tr><tr><td>Nieuwprijs nu</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1,015</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,309</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">3,281</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,002</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">2,254</span></td></tr><tr><td>Aantal opknapbeurten</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1.080,180</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">594,640</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">1,817</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,078</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">7,006</span></td></tr><tr><td>Aantal schademeldingen</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-2.042,942</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">610,809</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-3,345</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,002</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">7,175</span></td></tr></tbody></table><figure class=\"learning-figure\"><a href=\"assets/learning/college8-electrisch.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"assets/learning/college8-electrisch.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" alt=\"Werkelijke tegen voorspelde waarde en residuen voor Electrisch; gemarkeerde auto’s staan ook in de diagnosetabel.\"></a><figcaption>De diagonale lijn geeft werkelijke waarde = voorspelling; de tweede grafiek toont residuen en auto-nummers voor nader onderzoek. Open voor vergroting.</figcaption></figure><table><caption>Diagnoses met de cursusgrenzen</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Controle</th><th scope=\"col\">Uitkomst</th><th scope=\"col\">Grens</th><th scope=\"col\">Auto-nummers voor nader onderzoek</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Uitbijters y</td><td>z min <span class=\"inline-value\">-1,841</span>; max <span class=\"inline-value\">2,573</span></td><td>±2</td><td>23</td></tr><tr><td>Uitbijters x</td><td>MD max <span class=\"inline-value\">16,569</span></td><td>Gemiddelde + 3s = <span class=\"inline-value\">16,672</span></td><td>Geen</td></tr><tr><td>Invloed</td><td>Cook max <span class=\"inline-value\">0,475</span></td><td>Gemiddelde + 3s = <span class=\"inline-value\">0,270</span></td><td>143</td></tr><tr><td>Multicollineariteit</td><td>VIF max <span class=\"inline-value\">7,175</span></td><td>10</td><td>Geen overschrijding</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Normaliteit:</strong> Shapiro-Wilk, toetsingsgrootheid <span class=\"inline-value\">0,978</span>, p <span class=\"inline-value\">0,609</span>. Bij <span class=\"inline-expression\">α = 0,05</span> verwerpen we H₀ van normale residuen niet. Dit bewijst niet dat de verdeling exact normaal is.</p><table><caption>Heteroscedasticiteit: Pearsoncorrelatie van ABSRES met elke opgenomen x</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Verklarende variabele</th><th scope=\"col\">r</th><th scope=\"col\">p tweezijdig</th><th scope=\"col\">Signaal bij <span class=\"inline-value\">0,05</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kilometerstand</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-0,187</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,248</span></td><td>Nee</td></tr><tr><td>Nieuwprijs bij aanschaf</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,018</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,914</span></td><td>Nee</td></tr><tr><td>Nieuwprijs nu</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,461</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,003</span></td><td>Ja</td></tr><tr><td>Aantal opknapbeurten</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-0,326</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,040</span></td><td>Ja</td></tr><tr><td>Aantal schademeldingen</td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">-0,374</span></td><td><span class=\"inline-value\">0,017</span></td><td>Ja</td></tr></tbody></table><p>De bron houdt Kilometerstand (p ≈ <span class=\"inline-value\">0,085</span>) en Aantal opknapbeurten (p ≈ <span class=\"inline-value\">0,078</span>) in dit eindmodel. Die zijn bij een tweezijdige α van <span class=\"inline-value\">0,05</span> niet significant. De getoonde eindselectie is dus niet hetzelfde als backward met een verwijderingsgrens van <span class=\"inline-value\">0,05</span>. Vermeld het gekozen criterium; bij een andere grens moet het model opnieuw worden geschat. Een variabele wegstrepen terwijl de andere B’s gelijk blijven is onjuist.</p><p class=\"source-notes\" data-no-terms>Bronnen: <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-22\" data-source-note=\"22\" aria-label=\"Bron 22\">[22]</a> <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-24\" data-source-note=\"24\" aria-label=\"Bron 24\">[24]</a> <a class=\"source-note\" href=\"#bron-tentamen-23\" data-source-note=\"23\" aria-label=\"Bron 23\">[23]</a></p>",
